//// String case conversion: `toUpper` and `toLower` answer the same on every
//// backend. The host spellings (`toUpperCase`) are not methods of `string`:
//// `reject/primitive_method_undeclared.bp` pins the refusal.

test "toUpper raises every letter" { assert "abc".toUpper() == "ABC"; }

test "toLower lowers every letter" { assert "ABC".toLower() == "abc"; }
